# Input

```css
/* biome-ignore format: preserve literal separators */
@supports not at-rule(@future "a b") { .line { color: green; } }
/* biome-ignore format: preserve literal separators */
@supports not at-rule(@future "a b") { .paragraph { color: green; } }
/* biome-ignore format: preserve literal separators */
.control { content: "a b c"; }

```


